  },
  {
   "id": 219,
   "en": "Gaw-La Furia - Throne Room",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 220,
   "en": "Shana-Mia",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 221,
   "en": "Karo-Ran Vui...@You have done well to recover the Throne Unit.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 222,
   "en": "Karo-Ran",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 223,
   "en": "Sir!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 224,
   "en": "Da-Nia",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 225,
   "en": "I am deeply sorry, Your Highness,@for having troubled your heart for so long.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 226,
   "en": "Gu-Landon",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 227,
   "en": "As for Granteed's Larseilam...@It seems it was damaged, Eitelum and all,@by Karo-Ran's attack when E-Selda escaped.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 228,
   "en": "Are you saying it was my blunder?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 229,
   "en": "Let us be content that we avoided handing@our trump card to the Earthlings.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 230,
   "en": "...The Divine Dragon Basileus also has Larseilam.@If Granteed combines with it, there should be@no problem.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 231,
   "en": "Even so, two precious pieces@of celestial matter have been lost.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 232,
   "en": "So-Des's Raftclans, I hear, had its Eitelum@reach its limit before it could use Larseilam?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 233,
   "en": "The heavy use of late must have taken its toll.@I had expected it to last a few more times.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 234,
   "en": "(I knew he had sent me a knight unit@whose Eitelum was likely near its limit...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 235,
   "en": "And... the Throne Unit's pilots?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 236,
   "en": "They tried to cause trouble when taken off@Granteed, so I had them imprisoned.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 237,
   "en": "Anyone brought so suddenly to such a place@would react that way. I will speak with them@myself. Bring them here.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 238,
   "en": "That cannot be allowed.@Until moments ago, they were our enemies.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 239,
   "en": "I too believe imprisonment is appropriate@for those two.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 240,
   "en": "Yet it is a fact that he is coming to master@the Throne Unit, just as his father did...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 241,
   "en": "I shall persuade him and ask him@to lend the Fury his aid.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 242,
   "en": "Your Highness, you would accept E-Selda's son@as its rider...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 243,
   "en": "Surely that is the will of Fureim,@said to dwell within the Throne Unit.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 244,
   "en": "But even if he carries the blood of Shune,@that one's body is...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 245,
   "en": "Only one chosen by Fureim can command@the Throne Unit. We must accept that fact.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 246,
   "en": "No--we all should have accepted it the moment@he was born into this world.@That we are very close to one another.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 247,
   "en": "(...Preposterous.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 248,
   "en": "(Our god accepting one who is not Fury...@Impossible. It must not be.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 249,
   "en": "(Isn't it just a malfunction in the Throne Unit's@Cytron Control System?)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 250,
   "en": "For Granteed to fulfill its role as the \"key,\"@it is enough for Your Highness alone to ride it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 251,
   "en": "But then we could not handle the unexpected.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 252,
   "en": "The late Emperor was bold and valiant, but@we cannot place your person amid battle.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 253,
   "en": "Granteed and Your Highness need only serve as@the \"key.\" Our knights will destroy the <Vaula>@that spill out from the <Gate of Voda>.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 254,
   "en": "In the great war of old, we barely won only@because the Throne Unit and the Divine Dragon@fought on the front lines.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 255,
   "en": "Have no fear. Once the Zee-Gadin is complete,@I shall show you power rivaling@the Throne Unit's.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 256,
   "en": "(...It is impossible to persuade those@who opposed the plan here.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 257,
   "en": "Very well.@I withdraw the matter of the Throne Unit's@rider for now.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 258,
   "en": "A wise decision.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 259,
   "en": "However, I will go to the prison and meet him.@If you are concerned, come with me.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 260,
   "en": "Then I shall.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 261,
   "en": "(If Her Highness insists any further@on E-Selda's son, I shall have@to use that method...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 262,
   "en": "...By the way, Your Highness.@About the Coustwell, which I mentioned@before the sortie.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 263,
   "en": "What do you intend to do with it?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 264,
   "en": "Replace the subordinates I lost.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 265,
   "en": "The Coustwell also fought hard in the great war@of old... There's no telling how many more times@its Larseilam can be used.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 266,
   "en": "Not at all.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 267,
   "en": "(Even once will be enough.@My Karokuala's Eitelum must be@preserved for what lies ahead...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 268,
   "en": "Gaw-La Furia - Prison",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 269,
   "en": "Ugh... Ungh...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 270,
   "en": "Katia",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 271,
   "en": "Are you okay, Touya...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 272,
   "en": "Yeah, the pain's mostly gone. What about you?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 273,
   "en": "They just put me to sleep, so...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 274,
   "en": "I see... When they took us off Granteed, it looked@like a hangar, but it was bigger than the Hagane@or the Hiryu Custom--bigger than Izu Base, even.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 275,
   "en": "Yeah... I think this is the Fury's base,@but where could it be...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 276,
   "en": "Who knows...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 277,
   "en": "(That hangar... I feel like I've seen it before.@Why... Why do I...?)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 278,
   "en": "What's going to happen to us now...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 279,
   "en": "...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 280,
   "en": "...Son of E-Selda.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 281,
   "en": "!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 282,
   "en": "I have brought our liege.@I will tolerate no rudeness.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 283,
   "en": "...! Y-You're...?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 284,
   "en": "Huh?! You know her?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 285,
   "en": "Y-Yeah... She's the girl from my dreams...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 286,
   "en": "Dreams...?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 287,
   "en": "Yeah... I saw her a few times before I got into@Granteed... She'd talk to me, but I can't@remember what she said...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 288,
   "en": "But her face...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 289,
   "en": "You and I have met once before.@When we were small, E-Selda brought you here.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 290,
   "en": "Wh-What did you say!?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 291,
   "en": "Tou-Ya Shune...@I had hoped to see you again.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 292,
   "en": "You're...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 293,
   "en": "I am Shana-Mia Eterna Fura...@she who rules the Fury.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 294,
   "en": "Shana... Mia...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 295,
   "en": "Tou-Ya... I wish to welcome you, who carries@the blood of the Fury, as one of our own.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 296,
   "en": "!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 297,
   "en": "Th-Then, Mr. Seldoa was...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 298,
   "en": "Not only Tou-Ya.@Katia Grineal... the blood of the Fury@flows in your body as well.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 299,
   "en": "Tenia",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 300,
   "en": "Are you okay, Touya...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 301,
   "en": "They just put me to sleep, so...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 302,
   "en": "This is the Fury's base, right?@Where is it, I wonder...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 303,
   "en": "What's gonna happen to us...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 304,
   "en": "Huh?! You know her?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 305,
   "en": "Th-Then, Touya's dad was...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 306,
   "en": "Not only Tou-Ya.@Festenia Muse... the blood of the Fury@flows in your body as well.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 307,
   "en": "Melua",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 308,
   "en": "Are you all right, Touya...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 309,
   "en": "They only put me to sleep, so...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 310,
   "en": "Yes...@I think this is the Fury's base,@but where in the world could it be...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 311,
   "en": "What's going to become of us...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 312,
   "en": "Oh... You know that person?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 313,
   "en": "Not only Tou-Ya.@Melua Melna Meia... the blood of the Fury@flows in your body as well.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 314,
   "en": "Earth Federation Army Far East Command, Izu Base",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 315,
   "en": "Izu Base - Interior",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 316,
   "en": "...An <AM> platoon that launched from Hyakuri pursued@a black Raftclans heading from Shinjuku toward@Tokyo Bay, but it was beaten back.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 317,
   "en": "After that, gravity quake readings were detected@twice in the skies over Tokyo Bay.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 318,
   "en": "So it didn't transfer directly in front of us@because it was wary of a tracker or the like.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 319,
   "en": "Yes. And the reason we still haven't detected it@is either that the Fury's base is somewhere@undetectable...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 320,
   "en": "Or that they inspected Granteed somewhere,@removed every tracker, and only then@returned to their base.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 321,
   "en": "In other words, we have no leads.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 322,
   "en": "People on the front line are asking@to go rescue Touya and the others...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 323,
   "en": "I also think we need to find the bases of the Fury@and the <Dark Brain> remnants as soon as possible,@but the Steel Dragons look set to get another mission.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 324,
   "en": "What sort of mission?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 325,
   "en": "I haven't heard the details yet, but I'm due@to be briefed by the Commander after this.@I was told to bring Kota along.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 326,
   "en": "Then it's a mission involving@the Dark Brain remnants...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 327,
   "en": "That's what I think too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 328,
   "en": "Major Kai, I have a proposal.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 329,
   "en": "What's that?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 330,
   "en": "I'd like to gather the Steel Dragons' unofficial@members on the Kurogane and search@for the Fury's base.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 331,
   "en": "But we don't have any leads.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 332,
   "en": "Even so, we can't just sit on our hands.@Now that the Fury have Granteed back,@we have no idea what they'll do next.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 333,
   "en": "You mean to search blindly?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 334,
   "en": "No.@This all started at Ashurey Kreuzer on the moon.@We'll head there first and look for leads again.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 335,
   "en": "Sure, going back over the original scene@is standard investigative procedure, but...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 336,
   "en": "Hmm...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 337,
   "en": "If possible, I'd like Lieutenant Calvina on the moon@too. She used to be at Ashurey, and we'll need@someone who knows the site for the reinvestigation.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 338,
   "en": "Also, the Fury may make a move against@the Bellzelute Brigandi.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 339,
   "en": "...Isn't that dangerous?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 340,
   "en": "Lieutenant Calvina would probably welcome it, but...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 341,
   "en": "I'd also like to bring Fairy, Sieg, and Sally,@to look into the movements of the Gadisword@and the Golaikunru operating in space.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 342,
   "en": "...All right. I'll submit it up the chain.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 343,
   "en": "Izu Base - Briefing Room",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 344,
   "en": "Miles",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 345,
   "en": "New orders from the Joint Chiefs. At 0800 tomorrow,@our unit sets out for the <Garden of Baral> site@in the Middle East's Nafud Desert.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 346,
   "en": "The Garden of Baral...@I'd heard the follow-up investigation after@<The Sealing War> was behind schedule.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 347,
   "en": "Yes. Before this string of incidents, an@<LTR Organization> research team and an allied@escort unit finally headed out to the site...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 348,
   "en": "But after sending a garbled message saying@they'd seen a ghost, they went missing.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 349,
   "en": "That doesn't sound like something to overlook.@Why was it left alone until now?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 350,
   "en": "It came to light right after the Lamaris outbreak.@So it seems the response fell behind.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 351,
   "en": "However, after Operation Triumph ended, the Joint@Chiefs sent in another survey team...@and it found nothing.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 352,
   "en": "But there should be a massive crater where@the Garden of Baral rose up...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 353,
   "en": "The survey team couldn't even find that.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 354,
   "en": "What about satellite observation?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 355,
   "en": "Image analysis shows nothing but sand.@That was never the case before.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 356,
   "en": "For traces of something that huge@to just vanish...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 357,
   "en": "Sean",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 358,
   "en": "It's like magic... Ah, I see.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 359,
   "en": "Hell's bells, who'd pull off@somethin' that outrageous?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 360,
   "en": "Magic on sand. Doesn't that ring a bell?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 361,
   "en": "Ring a bell...? Oh! Fatso!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 362,
   "en": "That's right.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 363,
   "en": "(The Commander has good instincts.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 364,
   "en": "So I'd like to hear Roa's opinion.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 365,
   "en": "Sure. Mind if I use that monitor there?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 366,
   "en": "Go ahead.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 367,
   "en": "Roa, come on out.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 368,
   "en": "Roa",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 369,
   "en": "...Indeed, Debudedabide could use@barrier magic like that.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 370,
   "en": "Could the Dark Brain remnants have a base@at the site of the Garden of Baral...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 371,
   "en": "If so, the Lamaris they captured@may be gathered there.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 372,
   "en": "Did the Joint Chiefs foresee that much?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 373,
   "en": "No... I believe this mission came to us because@the Steel Dragons were deeply involved@with <Baral> during the Sealing War.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 374,
   "en": "But if the Lamaris are involved,@it's a fitting mission for us.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 375,
   "en": "Roa, if Debudedabide has put up a barrier,@can you see through it?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 376,
   "en": "If I get as close as I can and probe it with@the Kaiser Scanner, it's not impossible.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 377,
   "en": "Good... Then begin preparations@to set out at once.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 378,
   "en": "Roger.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 379,
   "en": "...Commander, there's something@I'd like to propose.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 380,
   "en": "Wow, I can't believe the Commander gave it the OK.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 381,
   "en": "He dragged his feet plenty, but when he checked@with the bigwigs, they approved it just like that.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 382,
   "en": "So they want us to keep playing decoy, huh.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 383,
   "en": "But thanks to that, we can go rescue those two.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 384,
   "en": "But I...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 385,
   "en": "Don't tell me--you're going to the site@of the Garden of Baral?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 386,
   "en": "That's what they're tellin' me. If Fatso's involved,@I oughta go, but I can't just leave@Touya and the others hangin'.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 387,
   "en": "Big Brother...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 388,
   "en": "I know how you feel, but we can go search@for the Fury's base because, unlike soldiers,@we have freedom of action.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 389,
   "en": "We'll do what only we can do.@Kota, you do what only you can do.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 390,
   "en": "...Got it.@Sorry, but I'm countin' on you Kurogane folks.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 391,
   "en": "Yeah, leave it to us.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 392,
   "en": "We'll rescue those two no matter what.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 393,
   "en": "Mizuho",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 394,
   "en": "Mizuho...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 395,
   "en": "(If only that had been ready in time...@this wouldn't have happened...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 396,
   "en": "Raji",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 397,
   "en": "Mizuho, instead of regretting things now,@let's do what we need to do.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 398,
   "en": "...Understood.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 399,
   "en": "Hiryu Custom - Interior",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 400,
   "en": "Kusuha, Bullet.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 401,
   "en": "Ibis... What is it?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 402,
   "en": "We're heading to the moon on the Kurogane.@So there's something I'd like to ask@you two going to the Garden of Baral site...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 403,
   "en": "...Is it about Irui?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 404,
   "en": "...! Good guess.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 405,
   "en": "We probably feel the same way.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 406,
   "en": "Yeah... I'm sure she's alive.@We've got next to no clue where she is now,@but...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 407,
   "en": "If you go to the Garden of Baral site@and find out anything...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 408,
   "en": "You do your best too, Ibis.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 409,
   "en": "Yeah, you too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  }
 ]
}